gn lines 231 and 251-253). The revised defaultSelectThread shows the list via ctx.ui.notify but then returns mostRecent.threadId at packages/pi-lhc/src/index.ts:157-176. The production test asserts notification plus most-recent behavior at packages/pi-lhc/test/lifecycle/thread-resolution.test.ts:255-290. The implementor artifact records this as a spec deviation because the available PI UI surface has notify but no interactive input.\"]}],\"baselineBeforeStory\":381,\"baselineAfterStory\":384,\"openRisks\":[\"Verification finding SV-001 remains unresolved.\",\"Verification finding SV-002 remains unresolved.\",\"Verification finding SV-001 remains unresolved.\",\"Verification finding SV-002 remains unresolved.\"]},\"cumulativeBaseline\":{\"baselineBeforeCurrentStory\":381,\"expectedAfterCurrentStory\":384,\"latestActualTotal\":384},\"commitReadiness\":{\"state\":\"not-ready\",\"reason\":\"Caller ruling is still required before impl-lead commit.\"},\"openRisks\":[\"Verification finding SV-001 remains unresolved.\",\"Verification finding SV-002 remains unresolved.\",\"Verification finding SV-001 remains unresolved.\",\"Verification finding SV-002 remains unresolved.\"]},\"cleanupHandoff\":{\"acceptedRiskItems\":[],\"deferredItems\":[{\"description\":\"Reload production path for no-flag/--resume uses cwd-most-recent registry selection, not the prior resolved thread id.\",\"reasoning\":\"Story verifier surfaced a production-path audit note. Verifier outcome, open findings, and explicit story-lead risk decisions determine whether action or caller approval is required.\",\"evidence\":[\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/docs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/artifacts/01-session-lifecycle-and-thread-resolution/004-verify.json\",\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/docs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/artifacts/01-session-lifecycle-and-thread-resolution/011-verify.json\",\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/docs/specs/