\",\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/pi-lhc/test/inference/startup-validation.test.ts\"],\"reviewScopeSummary\":\"Follow-up verification focused on carried blockers SV-001 and SV-003 after quick-fix/012. Reviewed touched assignment-default, startup-validation reporting, production construction path, focused tests, and configured gates.\",\"priorFindingStatuses\":[{\"id\":\"SV-001\",\"status\":\"still-open\",\"rationale\":\"The placeholder and deterministic/default default lane was replaced, but readiness is still not established. packages/pi-lhc/src/inference/model-call.ts now defines DEFAULT_PI_MODEL as provider `openai-codex`, id `gpt-5.4-mini`, and packages/pi-lhc/src/inference/assignments.ts returns that for loadAssignments(undefined). However packages/pi-lhc/src/index.ts still wires production inference through createModelCall(ctx), and packages/pi-lhc/src/inference/model-call.ts resolves every lane through ctx.modelRegistry.find(provider, model). The added proof in packages/pi-lhc/test/inference/startup-validation.test.ts constructs a mock modelRegistry containing that exact lane; it does not prove PI's real production registry contains `openai-codex/gpt-5.4-mini`.\"},{\"id\":\"SV-003\",\"status\":\"resolved\",\"rationale\":\"packages/pi-lhc/src/inference/startup-validation.ts now emits unreachable-lane reports through a headless channel when ctx.hasUI is false: report() calls an injected headlessLog or defaultHeadlessLog, and defaultHeadlessLog writes to stderr with writeSync(2, ...). packages/pi-lhc/test/inference/startup-validation.test.ts verifies the injected headlessLog receives the formatted unreachable-lane message, while health persistence remains covered.\"}],\"newFindings\":[],\"openFindings\":[{\"id\":\"SV-001\",\"severity\":\"major\",\"title\":\"Shipped default lane is still not proven production-reachable\",\"evidence\":\"packages/pi-lhc/src/inference/model-call.ts defines DEFAULT_PI_MODEL as `{ provider: \\\"openai-codex\\\", id: \\\"gpt-5.4-mini\\\" }`, and direct proof from loadAssignments(undefined).smoothed_prompt returned `{provider:\\\"openai-codex\\\",model:\\\"gpt-5.4-mini\\\",prompt:\\\"smoothing-v1\\\"}`. The production path in packages/pi-lhc/src/index.ts still uses createModelCall(ctx), and packages/pi-lhc/src/inference/model-call.ts resolves assignments through ctx.modelRegistry.find(provider, model). The test evidence in packages/pi-lhc/test/inference/startup-validation.test.ts proves only that a mocked registry containing `openai-codex/gpt-5.4-mini` validates successfully; no code, artifact, or external registry proof establishes that PI's real production modelRegistry contains this lane.\",\"affectedFiles\":[\"packages/pi-lhc/src/inference/model-call.ts\",\"packages/pi-lhc/src/inference/assignments.ts\",\"packages/pi-lhc/src/index.ts\",\"packages/pi-lhc/test/inference/startup-validation.test.ts\"],\"requirementIds\":[\"AC-5.4\",\"TC-5.4\",\"Real-Code Workaround Standard\"],\"recommendedFixScope\":\"same-session-implementor\",\"blocking\":true}],\"requirementCoverage\":{\"verified\":[\"AC-5.1: startup validation probes configured lanes through modelRegistry.find and hasConfiguredAuth\",\"AC-5.2 / TC-5.2: unreachable-lane reports now reach UI mode and headless stderr/log channel, and persist to health\",\"AC-5.3 / TC-5.3: affected derivation failure classification/queryability remained covered by current startup-validation tests\",\"AC-5.5 / TC-5.6: malformed placeholders and unknown assignment keys fail loud\",\"Story Gate: pnpm --filter pi-lhc verify passed\",\"Epic Gate: pnpm --filter pi-lhc verify-all passed\"],\"unverified\":[\"AC-5.4 / TC-5.4: shipped default assignments are not proven to target a real production-reachable PI modelRegistry lane\"]},\"gatesRun\":[{\"command\":\"pnpm --filter pi-lhc exec vitest run test/inference/assignments.test.ts test/inference/startup-validation.test.ts\",\"result\":\"pass\"},{\"command\":\"pnpm --filter pi-lhc verify\",\"result\":\"pass\"},{\"command\":\"pnpm --filter pi-lhc verify-all\",\"result\":\"pass\"}],\"productionPathFindings\":[\"Default assignments now use `openai-codex/gpt-5.4-mini`, but the production createModelCall(ctx) path still depends on PI ctx.modelRegistry.find(provider, model), and the current evidence only proves that a mocked registry accepts this lane.\"],\"recommendedNextStep\":\"revise\",\"recommendedFixScope\":\"same-session-implementor\",\"openQuestions\":[],\"additionalObservations\":[\"No material fake adapter, shim, or placeholder branch was found in the fixed headless reporting path; stderr emission is real runtime behavior.\",\"Configured gates passed, but gate success does not close the missing proof point for the default PI registry lane.\"]},\"errors\":[],\"warnings\":[],\"artifacts\":[{\"kind\":\"result-envelope\",\"path\":\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/docs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/artifacts/06-startup-validation-and-assignment-config/007-verify.json\"}],\"startedAt\":\"2026-06-14T13:31:57.927Z\",\"finishedAt\":\"2026-06-14T13:33:57.892Z\"}\ndocs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/artifacts/02-event-capture-and-turn-derivation/011-verify.json:1:{\"command\":\"story-verify\",\"version\":1,\"status\":\"ok\",\"outcome\":\"revise\",\"result\":{\"resultId\":\"b2a9b751-9264-49b9-80a6-545f877e5c48\",\"role\":\"story_verifier\",\"provider\":\"codex\",\"model\":\"gpt-5.5\",\"sessionId\":\"019ec588-aef8-7b91-b4f0-d6276d6a891a\",\"continuation\":{\"provider\":\"codex\",\"sessionId\":\"019ec588-aef8-7b91-b4f0-d6276d6a891a\",\"storyId\":\"02-event-capture-and-turn-derivation\"},\"mode\":\"initial\",\"story\":{\"id\":\"02-event-capture-and-turn-derivation\",\"title\":\"Story 2: Event Capture and Turn Derivation\"},\"artifactsRead\":[\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/docs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/stories/02-event-capture-and-turn-derivation.md\",\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-contex