D); their hashes diverged from red-manifest.json during Story-2's accepted codex quick-fixes. No Story-3 file is flagged. The run's story gate is `verify` (passes) precisely to avoid this guard — per the impl-log rationale.\"\ndocs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/artifacts/03-capture-verification/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:452:      - \"If green-verify becomes the enforced gate, red-manifest.json needs re-recording to absorb Story-2's already-accepted test edits (and the new Story-3 tests); that is orchestration bookkeeping spanning prior stories, not a Story-3 code change.\"\ndocs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/artifacts/03-capture-verification/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:505:  rulings:\ndocs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/artifacts/03-capture-verification/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:599:Allowed actions: run-implement, run-continue, run-self-review, run-verify, run-quick-fix, accept-story, request-ruling, block-story, fail-story\ndocs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/artifacts/03-capture-verification/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:619:Caller implication: Read the public status and final package to decide impl-lead follow-up such as accept, reopen, or ruling.\ndocs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/artifacts/03-capture-verification/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:622:Outcome: accepted\ndocs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/artifacts/03-capture-verification/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:626:Outcome: needs-ruling\ndocs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/artifacts/03-capture-verification/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:628:Caller implication: Surface the ruling request instead of guessing or downgrading the decision into cleanup debt.\ndocs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/artifacts/03-capture-verification/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:630:Outcome: blocked\ndocs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/artifacts/03-capture-verification/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:631:Meaning: A named blocker prevents safe forward progress with the current inputs or runtime state.\ndocs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/artifacts/03-capture-verification/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:632:Caller implication: Resolve the blocker or change the plan before resuming; do not pretend the story is ready to continue.\ndocs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/artifacts/03-capture-verification/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:665:{\"action\":\"request-ruling\",\"rationale\":\"...\",\"inputs\":{\"decisionType\":\"...\",\"question\":\"...\",\"defaultRecommendation\":\"...\",\"evidence\":[\"...\"],\"allowedResponses\":[\"...\"]}}\ndocs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/artifacts/03-capture-verification/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:667:{\"action\":\"block-story\",\"rationale\":\"...\",\"inputs\":{\"reason\":\"...\",\"detail\":\"optional\",\"evidence\":[\"...\"]},\"verification\":{\"finalVerifierOutcome\":\"block\",\"findings\":[{\"id\":\"...\",\"status\":\"unresolved\",\"evidence\":[\"...\"]}]}}\ndocs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/artifacts/03-capture-verification/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:674:- If the story file and test plan are insufficient for a safe next step, request a ruling instead of asking for epic, tech design, git status, or git diff by default.\ndocs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/artifacts/03-capture-verification/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:683:If readiness is promising but gate truth is failed, unavailable, or uncertain, do not accept. Choose the smallest safe next action: verify, quick-fix, block, or request a ruling.\ndocs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/artifacts/03-capture-verification/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:686:Request a ruling when story-local requirements are insufficient, when a blocker needs a caller decision, or when the evidence conflicts in a way that the durable record cannot resolve safely.\ndocs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-con