hread, capture, seedFork) return an LHC not_implemented OpResult, createModelCall returns a fail-closed 'other' failure, and replayCorpus returns matches:false — no stub reports success. initLhc is provided as the createSdk rename (A-4). Test fixtures: corpus loader (5 named lifecycles) with a real validateCorpus shape/coherence checker + makeTruncatedCorpus, synthetic PI/intake builders, deterministic ModelCall fakes, and a real temp-SQLite-thread factory. 6 foundation test files / 19 tests cover corpus validity (+ invalid builder rejected), synthetic coherence, ModelCall fakes, temp-thread create+reopen, hook-rail registration + fail-closed/plain-data handlers + init/dispose seam, and verification-config presence.\\\"\\n./docs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/artifacts/00-foundation/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-005.md:541:        path: \\\"packages/pi-lhc/src/lifecycle/fork.ts\\\"\\n./docs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/artifacts/00-foundation/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-005.md:542:        reason: \\\"ForkInfo type + detectFork (throws, no silent 'no fork') + fail-closed seedFork.\\\"\\n./docs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/artifacts/00-foundation/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-005.md:703:      - \\\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/pi-lhc/src/lifecycle/fork.ts\\\"\\n./docs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/artifacts/00-foundation/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-005.md:757:        - \\\"S0-FAIL-CLOSED-STUBS: capture, thread resolution, picker, fork seeding, model call, assignment validation, startup validation, pure capture helpers, and replay do not report production success before their owning stories; `rg` found no `ok:true` production result path in `src`.\\\"\\n./docs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/artifacts/00-foundation/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-005.md:809:      {\\\"type\\\":\\\"item.completed\\\",\\\"item\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"item_1\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"command_execution\\\",\\\"comma