-05-003\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"resolved\\\",\\\"rationale\\\":\\\"closed-loop coverage now routes one assignment to a success lane and turn_rendering to a classified auth failure, then asserts ready owners, failed owner counts, health failures, and overview ready/failed counts. Evidence: packages/pi-lhc/test/inference/closed-loop.test.ts:90-143.\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"SV-05-004\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"resolved\\\",\\\"rationale\\\":\\\"TC-4.4 now covers both halves: host returns ok:true with empty text for empty completion, and the LHC adapter records empty_output through inspect health. Evidence: packages/pi-lhc/test/inference/model-call.test.ts:235-310.\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"SV-05-005\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"resolved\\\",\\\"rationale\\\":\\\"the concurrency risk test now holds the first smoothed derivation result, edits the source message to queue version 2, releases the stale result, drains, and asserts sourceVersion 2 content landed while stale text did not. Evidence: packages/pi-lhc/test/inference/closed-loop.test.ts:147-228.\\\"}],\\\"newFindings\\\":[],\\\"openFindings\\\":[],\\\"requirementCoverage\\\":{\\\"verified\\\":[\\\"AC-4.1/TC-4.1: default initialization injects createModelCall(ctx), and model-call test verifies registry resolution, auth, exact completion text, and message passing.\\\",\\\"AC-4.2/TC-4.2: provider/model keys are routed through modelRegistry.find, and closed-loop assigns different derivation kinds to success/failure lanes in one session.\\\",\\\"AC-4.3/TC-4.3: failure classification for auth, invalid_request, rate_limit, timeout, network, and thrown/unknown values is covered, with createModelCall catch returning classified failures.\\\",\\\"AC-4.4/TC-4.4: host returns empty text as success and the LHC adapter records empty_output for empty resolved output.\\\",\\\"AC-4.5/TC-4.5: captured thread work drains through the scheduler and persists both ready and classified failed outcomes queryable through inspect health/overview.\\\",\\\"Architecture-Risk: Concurrency / Lost Update: stale background result is forced and verified not to clobber newer edited state.\\\",\\\"Configured gates passed: pnpm --filter pi-lhc verify and pnpm --filter pi-lhc verify-all.\\\"],\\\"unverified\\\":[]},\\\"gatesRun\\\":[{\\\"command\\\":\\\"pnpm --filter pi-lhc verify\\\",\\\"result\\\":\\\"pass\\\"},{\\\"command\\\":\\\"pnpm --filter pi-lhc verify-all\\\",\\\"result\\\":\\\"pass\\\"}],\\\"productionPathFindings\\\":[],\\\"recommendedNextStep\\\":\\\"pass\\\",\\\"recommendedFixScope\\\":\\\"same-session-implementor\\\",\\\"openQuestions\\\":[],\\\"additionalObservations\\\":[\\\"Production-path audit found no remaining mockComplete, placeholder completion text, or observeOnlyProvider default in the Story 5 connector runtime path; remaining fake ModelCalls are confined to tests.\\\"]},\\\"errors\\\":[],\\\"warnings\\\":[],\\\"artifacts\\\":[{\\\"kind\\\":\\\"result-envelope\\\",\\\"path\\\":\\\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/docs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/artifacts/05-inference-host-routing/008-verify.json\\\"}],\\\"startedAt\\\":\\\"2026-06-14T13:03:06.899Z\\\",\\\"finishedAt\\\":\\\"2026-06-14T13:04:50.351Z\\\"}\\ndocs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/artifacts/04-fork-as-new-thread/011-verify.json:1:{\\\"command\\\":\\\"story-verify\\\",\\\"version\\\":1,\\\"status\\\":\\\"ok\\\",\\\"outcome\\\":\\\"pass\\\",\\\"result\\\":{\\\"resultId\\\":\\\"6f89c00b-4771-418a-9dac-abfc7ddd30bd\\\",\\\"role\\\":\\\"story_verifier\\\",\\\"provider\\\":\\\"codex\\\",\\\"model\\\":\\\"gpt-5.5\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"019ec5f5-8cee-73a3-a1df-64da125e5d08\\\",\\\"continuation\\\":{\\\"provider\\\":\\\"codex\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"019ec5f5-8cee-73a3-a1df-64da125e5d08\\\",\\\"storyId\\\":\\\"04-fork-as-new-thread\\\"},\\\"mode\\\":\\\"followup\\\",\\\"story\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"04-fork-as-new-thread\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Story 4: Fork as New Thread\\\"},\\\"artifactsRead\\\":[\\\"docs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-con