ode/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/src/domains/intake-stream/index.ts\\\",\\\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/src/domains/intake-stream/internal/pipeline.ts\\\",\\\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/src/domains/intake-stream/internal/validate.ts\\\",\\\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/src/domains/inspect/internal/health.ts\\\",\\\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/pi-lhc/test/capture/converter.test.ts\\\",\\\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/pi-lhc/test/capture/turn-derivation.test.ts\\\",\\\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/pi-lhc/test/capture/parallel-and-errors.test.ts\\\",\\\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/pi-lhc/test/capture/abort.test.ts\\\",\\\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/pi-lhc/test/capture/idempotency.test.ts\\\",\\\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/pi-lhc/test/capture/reattach-idempotency.test.ts\\\",\\\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/pi-lhc/test/capture/support.ts\\\",\\\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/pi-lhc/test/fixtures/synthetic.ts\\\"],\\\"reviewScopeSummary\\\":\\\"Initial verification of Story 2 against AC-2.1 through AC-2.8, TC-2.1 through TC-2.9, current capture source/tests, artifacts, LHC duplicate-key behavior, and configured gates.\\\",\\\"priorFindingStatuses\\\":[],\\\"newFindings\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"SV-001\\\",\\\"severity\\\":\\\"major\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Fresh attach can skip a new same-content id-less message\\\",\\\"evidence\\\":\\\"AC-2.1 requires every finalized PI message to land exactly once, and AC-2.6 requires dedup to skip re-delivery without skipping genuinely new events. MessageEndEvent.entryId and position are optional in packages/pi-lhc/src/pi/types.ts:36-39. On every session_start, packages/pi-lhc/src/index.ts:309-314 initializes captureSession.sourceSeq to 0, and packages/pi-lhc/src/index.ts:354-359 uses sourceSeq only when no position exists. The message_end path uses that fallback when entryId is absent at packages/pi-lhc/src/index.ts:390-399. A focused check showed a first id-less/no-position user prompt and a fresh resumed connector's new same-content id-less/no-position prompt both map to the same key: `pi:thread-1:fp:message_end:sourceSeq:0:0:user:user_prompt:54ca60525216f9233258b2f6`. LHC skips duplicate keys at packages/lhc/src/domains/intake-stream/internal/pipeline.ts:210-216, so the new finalized event can be silently skipped. Existing reattach tests cover different-content resume at packages/pi-lhc/test/capture/reattach-idempotency.test.ts:49-69 and same-content reload re-delivery at lines 286-306, but not a new same-content id-less event after fresh attach.\\\",\\\"affectedFiles\\\":[\\\"packages/pi-lhc/src/index.ts\\\",\\\"packages/pi-lhc/src/pi/types.ts\\\",\\\"packages/pi-lhc/src/capture/idempotency.ts\\\",\\\"packages/pi-lhc/test/capture/reattach-idempotency.test.ts\\\"],\\\"requirementIds\\\":[\\\"AC-2.1\\\",\\\"AC-2.6\\\",\\\"TC-2.7\\\"],\\\"recommendedFixScope\\\":\\\"same-session-implementor\\\",\\\"blocking\\\":true}],\\\"openFindings\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"SV-001\\\",\\\"severity\\\":\\\"major\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Fresh attach can skip a new same-content id-less message\\\",\\\"evidence\\\":\\\"AC-2.1 requires every finalized PI message to land exactly once, and AC-2.6 requires dedup to skip re-delivery without skipping genuinely new events. MessageEndEvent.entryId and position are optional in packages/pi-lhc/src/pi/types.ts:36-39. On every session_start, packages/pi-lhc/src/index.ts:309-314 initializes captureSession.sourceSeq to 0, and packages/pi-lhc/src/index.ts:354-359 uses sourceSeq only when no position exists. The message_end path uses that fallback when entryId is absent at packages/pi-lhc/src/index.ts:390-399. A focused check showed a first id-less/no-position user prompt and a fresh resumed connector's new same-content id-less/no-position prompt both map to the same key: `pi:thread-1:fp:message_end:sourceSeq:0:0:user:user_prompt:54ca60525216f9233258b2f6`. LHC skips duplicate keys at packages/lhc/src/domains/intake-stream/internal/pipeline.ts:210-216, so the new finalized event can be silently skipped. Existing reattach tests cover different-content resume at packages/pi-lhc/test/capture/reattach-idempotency.test.ts:49-69 and same-content reload re-delivery at lines 286-306, but not a new same-content id-less event after fresh attach.\\\",\\\"affectedFiles\\\":[\\\"packages/pi-lhc/src/index.ts\\\",\\\"packages/pi-lhc/src/pi/types.ts\\\",\\\"packages/pi-lhc/src/capture/idempotency.ts\\\",\\\"packages/pi-lhc/test/capture/reattach-idempotency.test.ts\\\"],\\\"requirementIds\\\":[\\\"AC-2.1\\\",\\\"AC-2.6\\\",\\\"TC-2.7\\\"],\\\"recommendedFixScope\\\":\\\"same-session-implementor\\\",\\\"blocking\\\":true}],\\\"requirementCoverage\\\":{\\\"verified\\\":[\\\"AC-2.1 / TC-2.1: ordered user/assistant/toolResult capture and assistant thinking -> text -> tool_call fan-out are covered through the real hook -> converter -> LHC intake path in packages/pi-lhc/test/capture/converter.test.ts:43-87.\\\",\\\"AC-2.2 / TC-2.2: the worked example records one LHC turn_end at agent_end and PI per-step turn_end hooks produce none in packages/pi-lhc/test/capture/turn-derivation.test.ts:39-83.\\\",\\\"AC-2.2 / TC-2.3: two runs with repeated turnIndex 0 order by converter source-event order in packages/pi-lhc/test/capture/turn-derivation.test.ts:86-118.\\\",\\\"AC-2.3 / TC-2.4: out-of-order parallel tool results correlate by toolCallId in packages/pi-lhc/test/capture/parallel-and-errors.test.ts:39-77.\\\",\\\"AC-2.4 / TC-2.5: tool_result isError and error content are captured without drop in packages/pi-lhc/test/capture/parallel-and-errors.test.ts:80-105.\\\",\\\"AC-2.5 / TC-2.6: graceful interrupt partial content, aborted disposition runtime_note, and complete-but-aborted turn close are covered in packages/pi-lhc/test/capture/abort.test.ts:29-65.\\\",\\\"AC-2.6 / TC-2.7: same-key re-delivery skips are covered for entryId/source-position-backed cases in packages/pi-lhc/test/capture/parallel-and-errors.test.ts:145-191 and packages/pi-lhc/test/capture/reattach-idempotency.test.ts:88-136, 170-260.\\\",\\\"AC-2.7 / TC-2.8: malformed writable-thread input records a durable capture gap surfaced in health, unavailable store records health signal with no thrown hook exception, and unmappable hook input records a gap in packages/pi-lhc/test/capture/converter.test.ts:171-306.\\\",\\\"AC-2.8 / TC-2.9: model_select and thinking_level_select produce ordered runtime_note events with previous/new values in packages/pi-lhc/test/capture/converter.test.ts:90-152.\\\"],\\\"unverified\\\":[\\\"AC-2.1 / AC-2.6 / TC-2.7: a fresh resumed/reloaded connector receiving a new same-content message_end without entryId or position is not safe; current key construction collides with the prior thread's sourceSeq:0 event and focused evidence fails.\\\"]},\\\"gatesRun\\\":[{\\\"command\\\":\\\"pnpm --filter pi-lhc verify\\\",\\\"result\\\":\\\"pass\\\"},{\\\"command\\\":\\\"pnpm --filter pi-lhc verify-all\\\",\\\"result\\\":\\\"pass\\\"},{\\\"command\\\":\\\"pnpm --filter pi-lhc exec tsx -e '<same-content no-entry/no-position fresh-attach key collision check>'\\\",\\\"result\\\":\\\"fail\\\"}],\\\"productionPathFindings\\\":[\\\"packages/pi-lhc/src/index.ts resets captureSession.sourceSeq to 0 for every attach and uses it in fallback idempotency keys when PI supplies neither entryId nor position; because LHC skips duplicate idempotency keys, a new same-content id-less message after resume/reload can be skipped as a duplicate.\\\"],\\\"recommendedNextStep\\\":\\\"revise\\\",\\\"recommendedFixScope\\\":\\\"same-session-implementor\\\",\\\"openQuestions\\\":[],\\\"additionalObservations\\\":[\\\"Configured story and epic gates pass: 14 test files / 71 tests passed in each run.\\\",\\\"No material fake adapter, mock path, shim, or placeholder was found in the Story 2 capture path.\\\"]},\\\"errors\\\":[],\\\"warnings\\\":[],\\\"artifacts\\\":[{\\\"kind\\\":\\\"result-envelope\\\",\\\"path\\\":\\\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/docs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/artifacts/02-event-capture-and-turn-derivation/013-verify.json\\\"}],\\\"startedAt\\\":\\\"2026-06-14T10:37:10.140Z\\\",\\\"finishedAt\\\":\\\"2026-06-14T10:42:07.636Z\\\"}\\ndocs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/artifacts/01-session-lifecycle-and-thread-resolution/story-lead/001-events.jsonl:2:{\\\"storyRunId\\\":\\\"01-session-lifecycle-and-thread-resolution-story-run-001\\\",\\\"sequence\\\":2,\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-06-14T04:03:16.898Z\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"story-lead-provider-started\\\",\\\"summary\\\":\\\"Fresh story-lead provider turn executed without planner session resume.\\\",\\\"data\\\":{\\\"provider\\\":\\\"codex\\\",\\\"model\\\":\\\"gpt-5.5\\\",\\\"reasoningEffort\\\":\\\"high\\\",\\\"promptArtifactPath\\\":\\\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/docs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/artifacts/01-session-lifecycle-and-thread-resolution/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-001.md\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"019ec44c-29c0-79c0-be68-7dbbec44835f\\\"}}\\ndocs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/artifacts/01-session-lifecycle-and-thread-resolution/story-lead/001-events.jsonl:6:{\\\"storyRunId\\\":\\\"01-session-lifecycle-and-thread-resolution-story-run-001\\\",\\\"sequence\\\":6,\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-06-14T04:43:37.554Z\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"story-lead-provider-started\\\",\\\"summary\\\":\\\"Fresh story-lead provider turn executed without planner session resume.\\\",\\\"data\\\":{\\\"provider\\\":\\\"codex\\\",\\\"model\\\":\\\"gpt-5.5\\\",\\\"reasoningEffort\\\":\\\"high\\\",\\\"promptArtifactPath\\\":\\\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-l